# template — L2 (mass) template
#
# This folder is the template for each mass level within a metallicity.
# The parent mk_grid copies this folder for each mass in mass_grid,
# patches gen_grid_file with the mass value, then runs gen_grid_file
# and mk_mesa_inputs to create the L3 model folders.
#
# Scripts:
#   gen_grid_file   — Convert period_grid to input_grid CSV (mass, omega, period)
#   mk_mesa_inputs  — Create L3 model folders from input_grid
#   clean           — Remove all generated L3 folders and artifacts
#
# MESA_input_src/   — The MESA working directory template. Each L3 model
#                     gets real copies of inlist1 (patched for the model's
#                     mass and omega) and inlist_both, plus symlinks to the
#                     shared build in the physics set's
#                     ZdivZsun_template/template/MESA_input_src (star, rn, re,
#                     submit.sh, re_submit.sh, inlist, inlist_pgstar,
#                     history/profile_columns.list). submit.sh / re_submit.sh
#                     are for manually rerunning one model (cd L3 && sbatch
#                     submit.sh); no grid script calls them.
#                     L1/L2 copies of this folder exclude build products.
#
#   Inlists:
#     inlist           — Top-level loader (includes inlist1, inlist_both)
#     inlist1          — Per-model settings (mass, omega; patched by mk_mesa_inputs)
#     inlist_both      — Shared physics (EOS, mixing, winds, stopping, Z)
#     inlist_pgstar    — Plotting configuration (disabled in production)
#
#   Column lists:
#     history_columns.list  — MESA history output columns
#     profile_columns.list  — MESA profile output columns
#
#   Build and run:
#     src/run_star_extras.f90 — Custom wind, mixing, and stopping routines
#     mk               — Compile run_star_extras.f90
#     rn               — Run MESA (./star)
#     re               — Restart from saved photo
#     make/             — Makefile for compilation
#     clean             — Remove build artifacts
